    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Working.</strong> <em>Ambient hunger spilled outward from a wound that never closed.</em></p>\n<p>The shambler's mouth opens onto a place that isn't here. Each creature within near range makes a Resolve check (DC by tier); on a failure it takes 2d6 qliphothic damage to Stress and is Shaken until the start of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost.</strong> 2 Clarity, +2 Noise · action · burst / near.</p>\n<p><em>The room briefly tastes of iron and a memory you didn't have.</em></p>"
